2 CONT Lars Rasmussøn 1793-1842, bought half the farm from his father Rasmus Larssøn in 1793 for 650 rdl. Born 1764, died 1849. Married 1797 to Kristine Andrea Pedersdtr., B. 1771, died 1816. Four children: 1. Karen Anne, b. 1798, marrie
2 CONC d 1824 to Hans Kristensen Holt. 2. Anne Sofie, b. 1803. 3. Helene Marie, b. 1807, married 1829 to Guttorm Kristensen Hørdalen in Shd. 4. Rasmus, b. 1811, married 1835 to Anne Kristensdtr.
