2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-127771311-1-502412/tolf-madsen-agnalt-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-b42f919c15d5365ce14411b0b03f99c1&mrid=c0ada11763c8a9fde9dee91e32b36e9c MyHeritage
