1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Rasmus Larssøn 1752-93, came from Rød in Andebu, and gave 480 rdl. For the farm. Born 1729, died 1799. Married twice: 1. with Kristine Abrahamsdtr., B. 1725, died 1753. Kristine was from Rød in Andebu, and with her the man got a p
2 CONC arty in this farm. She had previously been married to Torsten Nilssøn Rød. Rasmus married a second time approx. 1754 with Anne Nilsdtr., B. 1733, died 1803, from Vestre Raastad in Sandeherred. Eight children in another marriage: 1
2 CONC . Christian, see below. 2. Maren, b. 1758, married 1784 to Kristoffer Iverssøn Vennerød. 3. Lars, see below. 4. Nils, born 1766; stayed here. 5. Berte, b. 1768, married 1786 to Anders Olssøn Lillevar. 6. Anne Marie, b. 1772, marri
2 CONC ed 1802 to Jakob Johannessøn. 7. Kristoffer, b. 1774, married and lives in Vaale in Andebu. 8. Hans, b. 1777, came to Sjuestok.
2 CONT In 1759 Rasmus Larssøn sold the mill to Kristoffer Kristofferssøn Haugene, but after 8 years he bought it back.
