2 CONT Kristen Rasmussøn 1784-1823, bought half a farm 1 from her father Rasmus Larssøn in 1784 for 450 rdl. Born 1755, died 1839. Married 1. 1792 to Berte Amundsdtr. Fuske, b. 1757, died 1803. She had previously been married to Even Han
2 CONC ssøn; married 2. with Anne Evensdtr. Two children (one and one): 1. Elen Andrea, b. 1795. - 2. Rasmus, see below.
2 CONT Rasmus Kristensen 1824-65. Born 1805, married 1825 to Maren Sibille Torsdtr. Gryte, b. 1802, died 1844. Seven children: 1. Anne Sofie, b. 1826.2. Karen Anne, b. 1828, married 1858 to Lars Larsen Skjelbrei, lives in Gjennestaad. 3.
2 CONC  Tellef, b. 1832. 4. Kristian, b. 1834. 5. Marte Marie, b. 1837, married 1856 to Kristian Kristensen Kongsteigen. 6. Matias, b. 1840. 7. Marte Sibille, b. 1844. In 1846 Rasmus married Sibille Johanne Torgersdtr for the second time
2 CONC .
