2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT lives in Sjuestok.  Hans Rasmussen ca. 1810-39, first had a part of the other Sjuestok which his father-in-law had also bought, but in 1809 it was sold to Ellev Torsen; then got half the dirt road with the father-in-law, and at hi
2 CONC s death in 1821 the whole. He was the son of Rasmus Vennerød in Arendal and born 1777. Married 1803 m. Taran Tjøstolvsdatter, born approx. 1784. - Hans Rasmussen died in the sad drowning accident 30 November 1839 in Tønsbergfjorde
2 CONC n (six people, including five from Sjuestok and one from Steinsholt, lost their lives during the crossing with a small barge.) His wife Taran died in 1848. - Children: 1. Rasmus Hansen , b. 1804, married 31 Maren Olea Kristensdatt
2 CONC er Borge; lived at Vestre Borge. 2. Karen Anne, b. 1806, married 1829 Helge Kristensen Var. 3. Anne Maria, b. 1810, married 33 Peter Kristensen Veer (see Mellem-Fen). 4. Mathias Hansen, b. 1812, married 38 Anne Helene Mathiasdatte
2 CONC r from Skjelbrei in Høijord, b. 1819; they lived on Solberg. 5. Berte Andrea, b. 1816. 6. Nils Hansen, see below. 7. Elen Lovise, married Mikkel Nilsen, see below.
2 CONT
2 CONT LM: comment: the burial was Nov 30, 1839. The drowning happened a little earlier.
