1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Nils Sorensson son of Soren Tolvsson and married to Maria Haakonsdatter from Stokke. Nils was involved in the unrest and later served as a sergeant. Over the years he became a well-to-do man and bought shares in Nordre Bergan and 
2 CONC Ostre Sem. He died 1749, his wife 1753. Children: Hans Nilsson, see below. Henry, died 1747, aged 22 1/2 years. Soren, first on Sem, then on Kjaer. Tolv, at Pinsle, Gjerstad, Auby. Thor non-commissioned officer, moved around, was 
2 CONC at Honnerod, Vestrum, Kjaer, Skinmo. Kari Mr. Ditman Himberg. Anne, g.m. Hans H. Kjaer. Anne married Rasmus Vennerod
