1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Sandeherred, Vestfold, Norway page 657. 1760-1783, Brother-in-law of the previous and son of Nils Sorensson Raastad. Like his father, he was a non-commissioned officer, and he had owned land on Ostre Sem and lived there for some y
2 CONC ears. It was small with funds, although he once bought a large share in Himberg. Married three times. 1. 1755 Helvig Larsdatter Auby, died 1761, 2 Kari Mikkelsdatter Vestre Virik, died 1778, 3. Berte Halvorsdatter. Soren died 1783
2 CONC , aged 48. Of the children, many woke up early, but seven grew up - two, three, two: Children: Nils, 28 years old at the death of his father, Ragne, 25. 3. Hans, died at the age of 33 years. Mikkel, married 1791 Oline Augrimsdatte
2 CONC r Freberg, apparently moved out of the village. Mari married Tor Berlykka. Hans was just 17 years old. Soren Sorensson later uses here.
