1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Nils Kristoffersen 1826-34. Born 1801, died 1834; married 1826 to Anne Kristoffersdtr. Nordre Holt. Three children: 1. Kristoffer, b. 1827. 2. Karoline Marie, b. 1830, married 1852 to Kristoffer Kristensen Aarholt. 3. Nikoline, b.
2 CONC  1834, married 1857 to Lars Henriksen Holt. After Nils' death, the farm was laid out in 1834 for his son Kristoffer for 900 spd. He remained in office until 1896. Kristoffer married Inger Andrea Ingebretsdtr in 1854. Søndre Kverne
2 CONC .
