1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Anders Olssøn 1782-1806, kjøpte Lillevar for 780 rdl. (hadde en kort tid gaarden sammen med broren Ivar). Anders var fra Rove og født 1759; døde 1807. Ved skiftet ser vi han hadde skaffet sig part i en gammel Nøtterø-brig, Emanuel
2 CONC , men hans bo stod ellers daarlig. Gift 1786 m. Berte Rasmusdatter fra Vennerød, f. 1768, døde 1811. - Of six children, three survived the childhood years:1. Olea Andersdatter, f. 1789, egtet 1815 Hans Hansen, se Grytingen. 2. Han
2 CONC s Andersen, se nedenfor. 3. Anne, f. 1793, lived unmarried, reached old age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Olssøn 1782-1806, bought Lillevar for 780 rdl. (Had the farm together with his brother Ivar for a short time). Anders was from Rove and born 1759; died in 1807. At the change we see he had acquired a share in an old Nøtterø
2 CONC  brig, Emanuel, but his estate was otherwise poor. Married 1786 m. Berte Rasmusdatter from Vennerød, b. 1768, died 1811. - Of six children, three survived the childhood years: 1. Olea Andersdatter, b. 1789, married 1815 Hans Hanse
2 CONC n, see Grytingen. 2. Hans Andersen, see below. 3. Anne, b. 1793, lived unmarried, reached old age.
