1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Hans Andersen 1811-1859, was born 1791, died 1859. Married 1820 m. Anne Helvig Abrahamsdatter, daughter of Abraham Larsen Haugan; she survived the man long beyond. At the change after Hans Lillevar in 1859, the estate was debt-fre
2 CONC e; the farm is valued at 3900 spd. - Nine children: 1. Berte Andrea Hansdatter, b. 1820, lived unmarried. 2. Abraham Hansen, b. 1822, see below. Maren, b. 1824, married 57 Lars Johan Hansen Skjelbrei in Høijord. 4. Rasmus Hansen, 
2 CONC b. 1826, see below. 5. Lovise Hansdatter, b. 1828, married 57 Ola Andersen Nedre Husum. 6. Hella Andrine, lived unmarried. 7. Olaves Hansen, b. 1833, became skipper; married 1865 Anne Maria Nilsdatter Bærevar, then widow of Karl K
2 CONC ristian Hansen Raastad; lived at Kleppan. 8. Amalia Hansen, born 1827, lived unmarried. 9. Lars Hansen, b. 1840, became a teacher.
2 CONT The road was laid in 1859 by the sons Abraham Hansen and Rasmus Hansen. They lived here for a lifetime; sold in 1890 the property to Sergeant L. M. Aas.
