1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Utdrag fra Stokke bygdebok om Sjuvestok:
2 CONT
2 CONT Part b. Nils Hansen 1841-85, overtok parten efter broren Mathias som hadde den en kort tid før han flyttet til Solberg. Nils var født 1819 og egtet 55 Berte Karine Johansdatter Steinsholt, f. 1826. Egteskapet var barnløst. - Ovenf
2 CONC or er fortalt at Nils Hansen 75 ogsaa overtok part a, saa han altsaa i sine sidste aar eide halve Sjuestok. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Nils Hansen 1841-85, took over the party from his brother Mathias who had it for a short time before he moved to Solberg. Nils was born in 1819 and married 55 Berte Karine Johansdatter Steinsholt, b. 1826. The marriage was childle
2 CONC ss. - It has been said above that Nils Hansen 75 also took over part a, so that in his last years he owned half of Sjuestok.
