3 TEXT Birth Surname
3 TEXT Karen Andersdatter Biørnland Ødegaard was born December 1771 on Biørnland Ødegaard, Tune, Østfold, Norway and was baptized December 29, 1771 in Tune kirke. Her name is later listed as Kari.  Her parents were Anders Busen (Bueson) 
4 CONC and Marthe Madsdatter Biørnland Ødegaard under Holleby., and Johanne Torbiørnsdatter Biørnland, Siri Madsdatter Biørnland, Johanes Brevig, Helge Askutsen Radet, and Ole Olsen Biørnland were witnesses at her baptism.   
